          {
            "title": "Order",
            "id": 89391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W przypadku warunku typowa kolejność polega na rozpoczęciu od wyrażenia, a następnie dodaniu pętli for i zakończeniu instrukcją if.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>score</code>, następnie <code>for score in scores</code> i na końcu <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ułóż wyrażenie listowe w odpowiedniej kolejności: wyrażenie, pętla <code>for</code>, a następnie instrukcja <code>if</code> zachowująca wyniki powyżej <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if score &gt; 29\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>score</code>, następnie <code>for score in scores</code> i na końcu <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
